"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1K051N4HQ1S02170\",\"title\":\"Corigin-1: BioChar Q3-25 — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"UNDER VALIDATION\",\"BICRS\",\"Corigin-1: BioChar Q3-25\",\"Corigin\",\"->\",\"PROJECT DETAILS\",\"Expected first certificates\",\"2026\",\"Project code\",\"CH3M\",\"Crediting period\",\"01 Mar 2023 to 01 Jul 2030\"],\"issued_header\":null,\"buffer_header\":null,\"crediting\":null,\"verifier\":null,\"code\":\"CH3M\",\"approval\":\"\",\"protocol_current\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.1\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":null,\"cert_retired\":null,\"cert_buffer\":null,\"reversal\":null,\"showing\":[\"Showing 2 of 2\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"05 Jan 2026\",\"Public Comment Summary\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"01 Dec 2025\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"https://corigin.co\",\"t\":\"Corigin\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/biochar/1.1\",\"t\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.1\"},{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1JZ01TQT51S00PB6\",\"t\":\"Learn more\"},{\"h\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/standard#validation-and-verification-process\",\"t\":\"Isometric Standard\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JZ01TQT51S00PB6/prj_1K051N4HQ1S02170/pjd_1KE7EZJ9R1S08JXB/public_comment_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JZ01TQT51S00PB6/prj_1K051N4HQ1S02170/pjd_1KBDEEGKT1S0WDF6/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"UNDER VALIDATION\\nBICRS\\nCorigin-1: BioChar Q3-25\\nCorigin\\n->\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nExpected first certificates\\n2026\\nProject code\\nCH3M\\nCrediting period\\n01 Mar 2023 to 01 Jul 2030\\nPROTOCOL DETAILS\\nCurrent protocol version\\nBiochar Production and Storage v1.1\\nSummary\\n\\nCorigin is a carbon removal business that produces multiple high value products from agricultural wastes. Biochar soil amendments help farmers increase yields and soil fertility while reducing chemical, fertilizer and water use. We help the World. Our biochar permanently removes Carbon from atmosphere and sequesters it into the earth where it remains in the soil for thousands of years.\\n\\nCalifornia\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nBiomass Carbon Removal and Storage (BiCRS) involves storing the carbon contained in waste biomass—organic material from living or recently living organisms. BiCRS works by halting or slowing the decomposition of biomass, enabling the carbon it contains to be stored long-term. This can be achieved by converting biomass into materials that decompose more slowly—such as biochar or bio-oil—or by storing it in environments where decomposition is slowed. For BiCRS to count as carbon removal, the biomass must be replenished to ensure additional carbon dioxide is drawn from the atmosphere.\\n\\nLearn more\\nProject timeline\\nCompleted 2025\\nInitial documentation submission\\nCompleted 30 Dec 2025\\nPublic comment period\\nCompleted 2026\\nAudit kick-off\\nCompleted 2026\\nSite visit\\nExpected 2026\\nIN PROGRESS\\nApproval date\\n\\nIsometric officially approves the project having reviewed the validation report produced by the VVB, documenting the activities, results, and conclusion of the audit. A full list of content requirements for the report can be found in the Isometric Standard.\\n\\nExpected 2026\\nInitial credit issuance\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n05 Jan 2026\\tPublic Comment Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n01 Dec 2025\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 2 of 2\\nPrevious\\nNext\"}"